# Deploy file list

After any change that is meant to show on the live site, end the reply with a **Files to upload** list.

- List every path that must go up, relative to the repo root.
- Group by what it affects (browser vs Node vs Apache) when that matters.
- Call out a Node restart if `public/server/**` changed.
- Do not list test-only files (`scripts/**`, `*.test.*`) unless they asked for those too.
- Do this every time, including small CSS/JS cache-bust edits.
